   HIVE_DEBUG=1 hive-cli <your command>   # guess; check the docs for the right env var
   ```
2. **Look for logs:** check `~/.hive/`, `~/.config/hive*/`, `~/.cache/hive*/` and `~/.local/state/hive*/`.
